# The speech model is a build input, not source. It is fetched into resources/
# by scripts/fetch-speech-model.mjs before packaging, and ships inside the app —
# but 75 MB of weights do not belong in git history.
resources/models/

# The VC++ redistributable is a build input, not source. build/windows-vc-redist.json
# pins its URL and SHA-256; scripts/prepare-windows-vc-redist.mjs fetches it into
# build/vendor/ before packaging and the NSIS installer embeds it from there. 25 MB
# of Microsoft binary does not belong in git history.
build/vendor/
